            "detailed_description": "Zachtronics is back with an ambitious new design-based puzzle game. Take on the role of a Reactor Engineer working for <strong>SpaceChem</strong>, the leading chemical synthesizer for frontier colonies. Construct elaborate factories to transform raw materials into valuable chemical products! Streamline your designs to meet production quotas and survive encounters with the sinister threats that plague <strong>SpaceChem</strong>.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Over Fifty Mind-bending Puzzles!<br></li><li>An original soundtrack by Evan Le Ny, whose music was featured in The Codex of Alchemical Engineering!<br></li><li>Twenty challenging achievements!</li></ul>",
